          <rdf:li>Glimmer is a Mess (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Falling In Love</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Idiots in Love</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Enemies to Friends to Lovers</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>joint custody of the cat</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Silly</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Humor</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff and Humor</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Pillow &amp; Blanket Forts</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>sun bathing in a tankini while looking that good is probably against the HOA</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Originally Posted on Tumblr</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Semi-Sentient Real Cat Melog</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Human</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Indoor Cat Keeps Jailbreaking to the Outside for Plot Purposes</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra has anger issues but she's working on it</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer is trying her very best</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Oblivious Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer is waiting for SOMEONE to ask her out</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and if she cannot get that then she'll do the asking damn it</rdf:li>
